From: Erik Conijn <egc112@msn.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 10:31:54 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] ARM: dts: BCM5301X: EA6900: use the flow accelerator's tag

Use the prepended Broadcom tag on the CPU port (port 8, gmac2), so that
the flow accelerator between them is in the path. The EA6900's BCM4708
has switch revision 3, which has the accelerator.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
Signed-off-by: Erik Conijn <egc112@msn.com>
---
--- a/arch/arm/boot/dts/broadcom/bcm4708-linksys-ea6900.dts
+++ b/arch/arm/boot/dts/broadcom/bcm4708-linksys-ea6900.dts
@@ -148,6 +148,8 @@
 
 		port@8 {
 			label = "cpu";
+			/* through the flow accelerator, see bgmac-fa.c */
+			dsa-tag-protocol = "brcm-prepend";
 		};
 	};
 };
